| `slides [file.pptx]` | Launch **LibreOffice Impress** (Presentations) |
| `pdf <file.pdf>` | Open **Atril** PDF viewer |
| `nmtui` | Open interactive terminal menu to scan and connect to any Wi-Fi network |
| `sudo install-mridhaos` | Install MRIDHAOS onto an internal drive partition (dual-boot safe) |
| `sudo poweroff` | Safely shut down and lock encrypted storage |

